Addition
- [N1] Within matched traces (1->1) added: action(n3,"invoice amount greater than $5000")

Mutation
- [N2] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b1,n4,"v1 = 'Yes'"); source=i3:If the invoice amount is greater than $5000; reason=The guard abstracts the condition to 'v1 = Yes' instead of evaluating the actual source threshold of 'greater than $5000'.
- [N3] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b1,n5,"v1 = 'No'"); source=i5:Otherwise; reason=The guard simplifies the alternate path to 'v1 = No', losing the complement logic of the source invoice amount threshold.
